{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_ex03_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_ex03","title":"林中小屋","storyCode":"CB-EX3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_ex03_end.txt","sourceHash":"c1e91f5f76773931fd0c915c763ea2208df3792e9cf8e47f8f89a5e8afb0c577","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這次，是肚子上被開了個洞吧？被那個感覺很酷的老頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯沒錯。我可是最前排觀看的，看得一清二楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得是什麼？會是替身嗎？還是特效？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，不可能，完全不可能。你親眼看看這段錄影就知道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔。這也太逼真了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再說了，大帝的替身？這也太曠世罕見了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上一次呢？我記得是他在獨自一人購物的時候，被突然竄出來的暴徒用弩槍貫穿了腦袋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那可做不到提前排練。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有汐斯塔的時候。音樂節上那次，私底下還有過無數人去找過他的麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那時候我也在，為了能碰碰運氣見到他，我特地訂了和他們就隔了一條街的酒店，可熱鬧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......他不是個歌手嗎？就算有錢了點，也不至於這麼招人記恨吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是你不清楚他的行事風格。先說好，我真的很佩服他，但在樹敵這方面，他大概也是全泰拉為數不多的天才。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聽說昨晚企鵝物流的倉庫發生了事故。他從火焰裡衝出來，根本不像受了傷的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很久以前有人目睹他在貧民窟被榴彈還是炸藥一類的東西直接命中，第二天毫髮無傷地出現在地下酒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這都不算什麼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊。但是腦袋被榴彈砸了個包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......明明是榴彈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，哥倫比亞的音樂界最動盪的時候，有傳言他被人槍殺在了街頭，引起了巨大的轟動來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是被毒殺了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！那時候我在哥倫比亞旅遊......我本來以為我這輩子都沒法再見到偶像了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是他活下來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"活下來了，還單槍匹馬去找過場子。說是要為那些年輕人報仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼情況？不死身？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"應該有不少假新聞吧？媒體可不能全信哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但命夠硬是肯定的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，也許把他捆在火山口，讓天災來對付他才有用吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我怎麼感覺就算這樣他也活得下來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊，我甚至能想像到他對著噴發的火山爆粗口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還會很押韻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......算啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰讓他是大帝呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
